1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,840
reading my school life.

2
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:08,680
Kitty wants to learn about school life around the world.

3
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:14,430
She has found some blog posts by teenagers from different schools.

4
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:18,075
Here are two posts from them.

5
00:00:18,075 --> 00:00:21,420
My name is Nancy.

6
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:25,980
I am at Woodland Secondary School near London.

7
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:34,100
Our school is small, so we have fewer students and smaller classes than most schools.

8
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:38,500
We go to different classrooms for different lessons.

9
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:45,580
There are many interesting subjects to choose from, like drama and foreign languages.

10
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:51,060
To us, Chinese may not be as simple as French or German.

11
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:55,560
However, I am looking forward to having a go.

12
00:00:55,560 --> 00:01:02,100
The arts are as important as languages, maths and science at our school.

13
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:08,060
We have a special building just for art, music and drama lessons.

14
00:01:08,060 --> 00:01:14,420
Being creative is great and it helps us study better in other subjects.

15
00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:19,945
Time flies when we are enjoying school.

16
00:01:19,945 --> 00:01:29,900
I am Tomoya from Japan, a grade 8 student at Gecko Middle School in Tokyo.

17
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:35,850
Japan is one of the countries with the most earthquakes in the world.

18
00:01:35,850 --> 00:01:40,490
Luckily, our school offers different safety programs.

19
00:01:40,490 --> 00:01:46,260
These programs teach us how to survive in the face of danger.

20
00:01:46,260 --> 00:01:52,660
Our school also pays a lot of attention to food education.

21
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:56,460
We learn how to cook meals and eat well.

22
00:01:56,460 --> 00:02:02,900
In this way, we are more aware of the importance of a healthy diet.

23
00:02:02,900 --> 00:02:08,670
Cleaning is another important tradition in Japanese schools.

24
00:02:08,670 --> 00:02:17,500
Every day at school, we clean classrooms, toilets and other school areas carefully by ourselves.

25
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:22,080
This helps us develop good habits from an early age.
